  "prefLabel": "Puc 904.07 Insurance",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Puc 904.07 Insurance. The customer-generator shall not be required by the distribution utility or any electricity supplier to purchase or maintain property insurance or comprehensive personal liability insurance to protect against potential liability resulting from the installation, operation, or ownership of the generation and interconnection facility.\n\nSource. #9515, eff 7-18-09 (from Puc 904.06); ss by #9998, eff 9-20-11; ss by #13080, eff 9-14-20",
